==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Le'saint]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*12 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*6 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Chickful A]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage isn't too hard due to the lack of pushers besides Mr. Angel, but it shouldn't be underestimated regardless. Heavenly Le'saint can crush a good amount of cats alongside Chickful A, so if you don't have good frontline tankers or a good amount of meatshields in your lineup they will push up slowly and kill you.

It is recommended that you have [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] at Lv.40+ and a Medium Research [[Cat Combo]] (You can use Defense Combos if Ramen isn't tanking as well as you hoped) and spam Ramen until you win. To expedite the process, use other rushers (i.e. [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev/Bullet Train Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]) or [[Long Distance]] units (i.e. [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]], [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Crimson Mina]], [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]) just so they don't get destroyed by Heavenly Le'saint.

